  "title": "SB 129 (2011-2012 Regular Session (2011)): House Substitute for SB 129 by Committee on Elections (2011, as amended by House Committee of the Whole): voter photographic identification; proof of citizenship; election dates; voter registration records",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.kslegislature.gov/li_2012/b2011_12/measures/sb129/",
    "https://www.kslegislature.gov/li_2012/b2011_12/measures/documents/sb129_02_0000.pdf"
